{
  "ID": "40143",
  "post_title": "Vacas y toros embolados en el Tossalet de Onda, a pesar de la lluvia",
  "post_date": "2013-08-29 13:07:44",
  "post_name": "vacas-y-toros-embolados-en-el-tossalet-de-onda-a-pesar-de-la-lluvia",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>La lluvia no ha impedido que este mi&eacute;rcoles las fiestas del barrio del Tossalet, en Onda, vivieran un nuevo d&iacute;a taurino, con vacas de la ganader&iacute;a del Paiportero, de Ondara (Alicante), por la tarde, y dos emboladas por la noche.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_6319.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La lluvia ha provocado que la tarde de vaquillas, patrocinadas por Rub&eacute;n y la Pe&ntilde;a El Paiportero, haya comenzado pasadas las 19 horas, pero no ha impedido que hubiera p&uacute;blico, incluso con paraguas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_6395.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /><br />\n Por la noche, pasadas las 23.30 horas, se ha embolado en la Era Grande un toro de la ganader&iacute;a del Paiportero, patrocinado tambi&eacute;n por Rub&eacute;n y la Pe&ntilde;a.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_6439.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La noche ha finalizado con la embolada de otro toro de corro de la ganader&iacute;a Hermanos Guillam&oacute;n, de Sant Joan de Mor&oacute;,&nbsp;patrocinado por la Comisi&oacute;n de Fiestas, en la&nbsp;calle Concilio Vaticano II. Ambas las han realizado el grupo Emboladors Consultora.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6316.jpg\" alt=\"img_6316\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6317.jpg\" alt=\"img_6317\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6318.jpg\" alt=\"img_6318\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6319.jpg\" alt=\"img_6319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6320.jpg\" alt=\"img_6320\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6354.jpg\" alt=\"img_6354\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6355.jpg\" alt=\"img_6355\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6356.jpg\" alt=\"img_6356\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6357.jpg\" alt=\"img_6357\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6358.jpg\" alt=\"img_6358\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6359.jpg\" alt=\"img_6359\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6361.jpg\" alt=\"img_6361\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6363.jpg\" alt=\"img_6363\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6364.jpg\" alt=\"img_6364\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousambaiguadimecrestossalet13/img_6365.jpg\" alt=\"img_6365\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src